  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The Photography.Book.Now 2011 competition is divided into four categories - Fine Art, Documentary, Travel and Student. Photography.Book.Now is a print on demand book competition judged and reviewed by an international panel of curators, photo editors, publishers and world-renowned photographers. The photography.Book.Now competition is presented by Blurb and the leading sponsor is the Hewlett-Packard Company.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Jury for the 2011 competition: Darius Himes (Assistant Director, Fraenkel Gallery Co-Founder, Radius Books), Gerry Badger (Historian and Photographer), Chris Boot (Executive Director, Aperture Foundation), Matt Eich (Photographer, LUCEO), Larry Fink (Photographer), Claudia Hinterseer (Director, NOOR), Henry Horenstein (Photographer), Whitney Lawson (Photo Editor, Travel + Leisure), Larissa Leclair (Founder, Indie Photobook Library), Jon Levy (Director, Foto8), Steve McCurry (Photographer, Magnum), Laura Brunow Miner Founder, Pictory), Markus Schaden (Publisher &amp; Bookseller, Schaden).</subfield>
  </datafield>
